E AX3049 1432-fixed-width-restrictions.ax:4:4-5 restriction-violated "`+` in the body of `wraps`, which claims `restrict(no-wrap)`" ?"Fixed-width addition, subtraction, multiplication and left shifts wrap at the declared width. Use explicit widening and checked Int arithmetic when the range fits Int, or remove this restriction when wrapping is intended."
E AX3049 1432-fixed-width-restrictions.ax:9:4-6 restriction-violated "`as` in the body of `narrows`, which claims `restrict(no-cast)`" ?"`no-cast` rejects explicit conversions in this body. Use an operation that preserves the required type, or remove the restriction. `no-cast:deep` also follows resolved callees; an unresolved path cannot establish the claim."
E AX3049 1432-fixed-width-restrictions.ax:14:4-5 restriction-violated "`/` in the body of `divides`, which claims `restrict(no-trap)`" ?"Fixed-width division and remainder trap on zero; signed minimum divided by -1 also traps. Shifts trap when the count is negative or reaches the type's width. Remove this restriction when these operations are intended."
E AX3049 1432-fixed-width-restrictions.ax:19:4-6 restriction-violated "`<<` in the body of `shifts`, which claims `restrict(no-trap)`" ?"Fixed-width division and remainder trap on zero; signed minimum divided by -1 also traps. Shifts trap when the count is negative or reaches the type's width. Remove this restriction when these operations are intended."
E AX3049 1432-fixed-width-restrictions.ax:24:4-6 restriction-violated "`<<` in the body of `shiftedWrap`, which claims `restrict(no-wrap)`" ?"Fixed-width addition, subtraction, multiplication and left shifts wrap at the declared width. Use explicit widening and checked Int arithmetic when the range fits Int, or remove this restriction when wrapping is intended."
